# 5. THE PRECISION INTELLIGENCE DESIGN SYSTEM

Create one coherent visual system across the entire application.

## Visual identity

The interface must feel:

- Confident
- Precise
- Mature
- Calm
- Sophisticated
- Highly functional
- Beautifully organized
- Deliberately designed

Use restrained color and strong typography.

### Color foundation

| Purpose | Value |
|---|---|
| Primary navigation | `#0B1728` |
| Secondary navy | `#172D49` |
| Primary action | `#285EE8` |
| Primary action hover | `#194BC8` |
